# 4. Pricing
c('pricing', 'ElevenAgents list price 2026-10-20: $0.08 per call minute on every plan (Free 15 min/4 concurrent; Starter $6 75/6; Creator $22 275/10; Pro $99 1,238/20; Scale $299 3,738/30; Business $990 12,375/40), burst above the concurrency limit at $0.16 (up to 3x concurrency), text messages $0.003, LLM billed on top at provider rates, no ElevenLabs telephony fee. Unchanged in USD from 2026-06-06 and 2026-10-17 (l4a pricing-history.json).', 'observed', D + 'pricing/elevenlabs.io_pricing_agents.html.txt', T + 'pricing-allin.json', 'research/2026-10-17/lanes/l4a-competitors/pricing-history.json')
c('pricing', 'Silent periods are billed at 5% of the per-minute rate; queue wait time is not billed.', 'vendor-claimed', D + 'docs-md/eleven-agents__customization__llm__optimizing-costs.md', D + 'help-md/product__eleven-agents__how-many-eleven-agents-requests-can-i-make-and-can-i-increase-it.md')
c('pricing', 'All-in list price for an Indian outbound minute at FX 95: INR 8.17-8.92 via Exotel or Plivo (platform INR 7.60 + LLM INR 0.19-0.72 + telephony INR 0.38-0.60); INR 15.8-16.5 in burst; INR 12.5-15.0 via Twilio to an Indian mobile. That is about 2x Sarvam (INR 3.4-3.9) and above the INR 3.5-7 Indian band.', 'inferred', T + 'pricing-allin.json', 'research/2026-10-18/lanes/g4-market-selfhost/prices.csv', 'research/2026-10-17/lanes/l2-economics/report.md')
c('pricing', 'The $0.08 platform fee is 3.9x what the same ASR and TTS cost on ElevenLabs\' own API list (Scribe v2 Realtime $0.39/h = $0.0065/min plus Flash/Turbo TTS $0.04 per 1K chars x 352 chars = $0.0141/min).', 'inferred', T + 'pricing-allin.json', D + 'pricing/elevenlabs.io_pricing_api.html.txt')
c('pricing', 'Reconstructed platform COGS (own ASR + own TTS on own GPUs, self-hosted LiveKit on GCP, LLM passed through): INR 0.20-1.38 per minute, implying 82-97% gross margin on the INR 7.60 platform fee; ElevenLabs could price an Indian minute near Sarvam\'s and stay profitable.', 'inferred', T + 'pricing-allin.json', 'research/2026-10-18/lanes/g4-market-selfhost/findings.md')
c('pricing', 'India billing: subscriptions can be paid in INR with UPI for customers located in India; prices are otherwise identical.', 'vendor-claimed', D + 'help-md/account__payment-billing__can-i-pay-for-my-eleven-labs-subscription-in-inr.md')
